            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# ✨ 本次更新

## ☁️ iCloud 同步优化

* iCloud 同步现在支持自定义文本同步大小，可根据需要调整同步范围。
* 修复大文本同步时可能导致同步队列卡死的问题，提升同步稳定性。

## 📱 移动端同步策略调整

* 优化移动端同步策略，减少不必要的同步操作，提升使用体验和同步效率。

赶快更新体验吧！✨

---

# ✨ What's New

## ☁️ iCloud Sync Improvements

* iCloud Sync now lets you choose the maximum text size to sync, giving you more control over synced content.
* Fixed an issue where syncing large text content could cause the sync queue to become stuck.

## 📱 Mobile Sync Strategy Updates

* Updated the sync strategy on mobile devices to reduce unnecessary sync operations and improve overall efficiency.

Update now and enjoy a more stable syncing experience! ✨

]]></description>
